        "name": "CCTV Detector - Backend Web API",
        "description": "Postman collection for backend-web REST API.\n\nFlow:\n1) Seed dummy users via `npm run seed:dummy-users`\n2) POST /auth/login → token auto-saved to collection variable\n3) Call protected endpoints with Bearer {{token}}\n\nRecommended test order:\n  Login → POST Area → POST AI Model → POST PIC → POST Camera → POST Mapping\n\n**Phase 2:** AI Models, PIC, Camera Mappings\n**Phase 7:** System Settings, Camera test-connection, Cleanup worker",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
